  "body": "## Summary\n\n- synchronize the server and web release mirrors at 0.38.1\n- prepare immutable source tag v0.38.1\n- leave Android phone and Wear release identities unchanged\n\n## Validation\n\n- exact candidate identity and synchronized release mirrors\n- production image build, readiness, and served-Web smoke\n- required CI must succeed on this exact candidate before merge; approval or missing checks block finalization\n\nCandidate metadata and production smoke passed. Cut release now waits for this PR\u2019s CI; approve pending workflow runs if GitHub requests it. After CI and merge, image publication runs explicitly; OTA and deployment have separate readiness gates.",
